<topic xml:id="sle15-packages-lifecycle-bci"
 role="concept" xml:lang="en"
 xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook" version="5.2"
 xmlns:its="http://www.w3.org/2005/11/its"
 xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"
 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
 xmlns:trans="http://docbook.org/ns/transclusion">
  <info>
    <title>Base Container Images (BCI) support</title>
    <meta name="maintainer" content="lkucharczyk@suse.com" its:translate="no"/>
  </info>
  <para>OS base container images (such as <literal>bci-base</literal>, <literal>bci-minimal</literal>, <literal>bci-micro</literal>, <literal>bci-init</literal>, and <literal>bci-busybox</literal>) are supported and updated throughout the entire lifetime of the Service Pack.</para>
  <para>This support extends through both the General Support phase and the LTSS phase of the respective Service Pack.</para>
</topic>
